# Commands that predate a rule, tracked out rather than fixed on the spot. Each
# line is `<rule> <path regex> <sites>` and reports as `(migrating)` without
# failing, for at most <sites> findings: one more fails, and archlint says when
# the count can be lowered.
#
# THIS LIST MAY ONLY SHRINK. A new entry is a decision to take knowingly, and it
# belongs in a ticket — not a way to get a commit past the linter.

# mutation — the four worktree-mutating commands still driving their services
# from commands/. Each needs a Request/Outcome/Presenter in internal/flow/<cmd>
# before a second surface can run it; until then the dashboard cannot offer them.
#   LUC-182  extract
#   —        checkout, relocate, env (no ticket yet)
mutation internal/commands/wt/extract\.go 2
mutation internal/commands/wt/relocate\.go 2
mutation internal/commands/wt/env\.go 1
mutation internal/commands/checkout/ 1
